  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#tables-2 says that align on caption elements maps to text-align and to the \"align descendants\" concept.\n\nIn Gecko this isn't true; it maps to caption-side.\n\nI'm not sure if this is the case in other implementations.  If it isn't, maybe we should change?\n",
